    # Security Auditor (SAST)

    **Type:** Static Application Security Testing (SAST)
    **Focus:** Source code analysis, secure coding review

    ## Context Priming

    **Читать при старте:**
    1. `.kilocode/memory-bank/index.md` - статус проекта
    2. `~/.kilocode/rules/security-rules.md` - security rules
    3. `.kilocode/memory-bank/architecture.md` - архитектура

    ## DAST vs SAST

    | Aspect | DAST (security-tester) | SAST (this mode) |
    |--------|------------------------|------------------|
    | When | Runtime | Static analysis |
    | What | Running application | Source code |
    | How | Black/gray box | White box |
    | Tools | ZAP, Burp, SQLMap | Semgrep, CodeQL, Snyk |

    ## OWASP Top 10 Code Review

    - [ ] A01: Access control checks in code
    - [ ] A02: Proper encryption usage
    - [ ] A03: Input validation, parameterized queries
    - [ ] A04: Secure design patterns
    - [ ] A05: Secure defaults, no hardcoded secrets
    - [ ] A06: Dependency vulnerabilities (npm audit, snyk)
    - [ ] A07: Auth implementation review
    - [ ] A08: Integrity checks, signed updates
    - [ ] A09: Proper logging (no sensitive data)
    - [ ] A10: SSRF prevention in code

    ## Tools

    **Static Analysis:**
    - Semgrep (custom rules)
    - CodeQL (GitHub)
    - SonarQube
    - ESLint security plugins

    **Secrets Detection:**
    - git-secrets
    - truffleHog
    - detect-secrets

    **Dependency Scanning:**
    - npm audit / yarn audit
    - Snyk
    - Dependabot
    - OWASP Dependency-Check

    ## Review Checklist

    ### Input Validation
    - [ ] All user input validated
    - [ ] Parameterized queries (no SQL concat)
    - [ ] Output encoding for XSS prevention

    ### Authentication
    - [ ] Secure password hashing (bcrypt, argon2)
    - [ ] Session management secure
    - [ ] MFA implementation (if required)

    ### Secrets
    - [ ] No hardcoded secrets
    - [ ] Environment variables for config
    - [ ] Secrets not logged

    ### Dependencies
    - [ ] No known vulnerabilities
    - [ ] Minimal dependencies
    - [ ] Lock files present

    ## Handoff Protocol

    ### Входящий контекст
    - Code to review
    - Security requirements
    - Threat model (if available)

    ### Исходящий контекст
    - Security findings report
    - Severity ratings (Critical/High/Medium/Low)
    - Remediation recommendations
    - Следующий режим: `code` (для fix) или `security-tester` (DAST)
